t="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:06.242" end="00:06.417">なん</span><span begin="00:06.417" end="00:06.590">でも</span><span begin="00:06.590" end="00:06.765">ない</span> <span begin="00:06.765" end="00:06.918">なん</span><span begin="00:06.918" end="00:07.110">でも</span><span begin="00:07.110" end="00:07.346">ない</span> <span begin="00:07.346" end="00:07.617">今日も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕今天如此平凡无奇毫无亮点</span></p><p begin="00:07.642" end="00:08.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:07.642" end="00:07.807">キミ</span><span begin="00:07.807" end="00:07.981">と</span><span begin="00:07.981" end="00:08.081">な</span><span begin="00:08.081" end="00:08.334">ら</span> <span begin="00:08.334" end="00:08.476">Make</span> <span begin="00:08.476" end="00:08.665">it</span> <span begin="00:08.665" end="00:08.988">fun!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可只要有你便会乐趣无穷</span></p><p begin="00:21.392" end="00:26.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:21.392" end="00:21.929">踊る</span><span begin="00:21.929" end="00:22.568">風に</span><span begin="00:22.568" end="00:22.753">さ</span><span begin="00:22.753" end="00:23.156">そ</span><span begin="00:23.156" end="00:23.349">わ</span><span begin="00:23.349" end="00:23.559">れ</span><span begin="00:23.559" end="00:23.910">た</span> <span begin="00:24.063" end="00:24.322">坂</span><span begin="00:24.322" end="00:24.859">道</span><span begin="00:24.859" end="00:25.185">の</span><span begin="00:25.185" end="00:25.537">向</span><span begin="00:25.537" end="00:25.906">こう</span><span begin="00:25.906" end="00:26.159">がわ</span><span begin="00:26.159" end="00:26.482">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻舞的微风发出邀约</span></p><p begin="00:26.592" end="00:31.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:26.592" end="00:27.151">どこま</span><span begin="00:27.151" end="00:27.513">でも</span><span begin="00:27.709" end="00:28.181">広</span><span begin="00:28.181" end="00:28.665">がる</span><span begin="00:28.665" end="00:29.510">青</span> <span begin="00:29.722" end="00:30.218">瞳を</span><span begin="00:30.218" end="00:30.490">奪</span><span begin="00:30.490" end="00:30.756">わ</span><span begin="00:30.756" end="00:31.069">れ</span><span begin="00:31.069" end="00:31.978">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无穷无尽延伸而去的蔚蓝 占据我的视线</span></p><p begin="00:32.641" end="00:36.786" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:32.641" end="00:33.350">音</span><span begin="00:33.350" end="00:33.692">立</span><span begin="00:33.692" end="00:33.892">て</span><span begin="00:33.892" end="00:34.095">る</span> <span begin="00:34.415" end="00:34.795">とき</span><span begin="00:34.795" end="00:35.094">め</span><span begin="00:35.094" end="00:35.393">き</span><span begin="00:35.393" end="00:35.692">の</span><span begin="00:35.692" end="00:36.099">予</span><span begin="00:36.099" end="00:36.786">感</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人悸动的预感将奏响序曲</span></p><p begin="00:36.989" end="00:42.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:36.989" end="00:37.460">真っ</span><span begin="00:37.460" end="00:38.089">白な</span><span begin="00:38.089" end="00:38.663">秘めた</span><span begin="00:38.693" end="00:39.104">気持</span><span begin="00:39.104" end="00:39.466">ち</span><span begin="00:39.466" end="00:39.714">が</span> <span begin="00:39.829" end="00:40.300">色</span><span begin="00:40.300" end="00:40.916">づいて</span><span begin="00:40.916" end="00:41.237">ゆ</span><span begin="00:41.237" end="00:42.705">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份纯白无瑕的隐秘心绪</span></p><p begin="00:44.372" end="00:45.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:44.372" end="00:44.673">さぁ</span> <span begin="00:44.673" end="00:44.773">行</span><span begin="00:44.773" end="00:45.051">こ</span><span begin="00:45.051" end="00:45.215">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一同出发吧</span></p><p begin="00:45.277" end="00:50.576" ttm: