" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 都能笑着击掌庆贺</span></p><p begin="01:25.517" end="01:30.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:25.517" end="01:25.688">あの</span><span begin="01:25.688" end="01:26.025">日</span><span begin="01:26.025" end="01:26.257">に</span><span begin="01:26.257" end="01:26.594">キ</span><span begin="01:26.594" end="01:26.875">ミが</span><span begin="01:26.875" end="01:27.168">か</span><span begin="01:27.168" end="01:27.400">ざ</span><span begin="01:27.400" end="01:27.659">し</span><span begin="01:27.659" end="01:28.084">た</span> <span begin="01:28.267" end="01:28.493">空</span><span begin="01:28.493" end="01:28.787">に</span><span begin="01:28.787" end="01:28.972">透</span><span begin="01:28.972" end="01:29.370">か</span><span begin="01:29.370" end="01:29.658">す</span><span begin="01:29.658" end="01:30.108">シー</span><span begin="01:30.108" end="01:30.333">グラ</span><span begin="01:30.333" end="01:30.783">ス</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天你高高举起的那颗</span></p><p begin="01:30.694" end="01:36.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:30.694" end="01:31.074">どこ</span><span begin="01:31.074" end="01:31.707">までも</span><span begin="01:31.923" end="01:32.450">深い</span><span begin="01:32.450" end="01:33.225">青</span><span begin="01:33.225" end="01:33.644">に</span> <span begin="01:33.817" end="01:34.385">キラリ</span><span begin="01:34.385" end="01:35.182">輝</span><span begin="01:35.182" end="01:35.476">い</span><span begin="01:35.476" end="01:36.067">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无限延伸的深邃蔚蓝中璀璨闪耀</span></p><p begin="01:36.804" end="01:40.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:36.804" end="01:37.474">重</span><span begin="01:37.474" end="01:37.860">ね</span><span begin="01:37.860" end="01:38.358">る</span> <span begin="01:38.477" end="01:39.094">君</span><span begin="01:39.094" end="01:39.534">色</span><span begin="01:39.534" end="01:40.253">フィル</span><span begin="01:40.253" end="01:40.892">ター</span><sp